            text: "Asphalt blacktop sealers are largely a seasonal item, stocked heavily from spring through early fall and thinned out in winter, because they must be applied in warm, dry conditions above about 50 degrees. Concrete sealers like BEHR Premium and Foundation Armor are typically available year-round since they are used for many projects. If you are sealing asphalt, shop in late spring or summer for the best selection and the right weather.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How long does Home Depot driveway sealer last?",
