              <p class="text-gray-700">No single sealer does both well. Home Depot stocks two distinct categories: black asphalt emulsion sealers (Latex-ite, BLACK JACK, Henry, Rust-Oleum EPOXYSHIELD) for blacktop, and clear or wet-look acrylic and penetrating sealers (BEHR Premium, Foundation Armor) for concrete. Using the wrong category leads to poor adhesion and quick failure. Identify your surface first, then choose the matching product.</p>
